\b sb-easy Windows development preview\b0\par\par
This installer adds the desktop application and an automatically started Windows service running as LocalSystem. Administrator permission is required for installation. Open sb-easy normally from the Start menu after setup.\par\par
Installing or starting the service does not enable the VPN. Connections start only when requested from the desktop. TUN connections can change adapters, routes and DNS.\par\par
Close the portable edition and stop its backend before installing. Portable and installed editions use different protected device stores; enroll again in the installed edition.\par\par
Uninstall stops the connection and removes installed program files and shortcuts. Saved device data in ProgramData is retained for reinstall. Use Forget Device in the application before uninstall if you want to remove the registration.\par\par
This is an unsigned development preview. Third-party notices are installed with the application. Microsoft Edge WebView2 Evergreen Runtime is a separate prerequisite.\par
